WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.268
-Welcome, welcome, welcome,

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.604
welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.873
We are here.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:10.610
Studio 6A in New York City.
It feels good.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.112
Thank you so much for watching.
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:15.381
Well, guys, I think it's fair
to say that right now

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:17.417
America is at a crossroads.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.118
It doesn't get much bigger
than this.

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:22.121
So we begin tonight
with our top story.

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:25.758
-Get excited because McDonald's
is bringing back the McRib.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:28.394
-That's right.
[ Laughter and cheers ]

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.396
Americans were like,
"Finally, a glimmer of hope

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:32.899
in the barren wasteland
that's been 2020."

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.402
When he heard about it,
Trump dropped out of the race

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:37.604
and said, "I'm done.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.138
Clearly, I've
'made America great again.'

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.074
The McRib."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.842
Somehow you know
2020 will wrap up

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.810
with the McRib being the cure
for COVID.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.513
You know that, right?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:52.084
In other less exciting news, the
election is just four days away.

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:54.820
And Trump is busy campaigning,
but I saw a new poll

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.657
that found that nearly 60%
of Americans disapprove

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.893
of Trump holding large rallies
during the pandemic.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:02.895
So, not only are the rallies
dangerous,

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.764
they're also unpopular.

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.699
They're basically the kid
in high school

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.434
who played with
the Bunsen burners.

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.203
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.938
Seriously, if you want to do
something dangerous

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:15.475
and unpopular, go to your local
Blimpie and order the tuna.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:18.544
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:20.279
That's right, Trump is still
holding rallies,

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.114
including one yesterday
in Tampa,

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.750
but it didn't go quite
as planned, watch this.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.053 line:0%
-Just two days after
President Trump's rally

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:29.189 line:0%
in Omaha, Nebraska,
sent several supporters

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.491 line:0%
to the hospital
for being too cold,

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.427 line:0%
his rally in Tampa, Florida,
yesterday sent even more

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.796 line:0%
to the hospital
for being too hot.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.599
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.367
-Don't worry, Trump had
everyone cool off

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.202
by blowing
in each other's faces.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.738
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:48.340
Actually, Trump said we are only
seeing more cases of heatstroke

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.443
because we have
the most testing.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.278
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.414
Years from now, Trump supporters
will be reminiscing

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.416
about these rallies like
they're old concerts.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.384
Like, "Were you at the
hypothermia rally?"

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:03.055
"Nah, I caught him on the
heatstroke leg of the tour."

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:05.391
Yeah, it was so hot in Tampa,
a fire truck --

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.761
this is real -- actually
sprayed water over the crowd.

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:11.097
But Trump didn't seem to know
what was happening.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.565
Check out what he said.

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:15.435
-Look at that. Oh, are they
doing that on purpose?

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:17.170
[ Crowd cheers ]

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:19.238
Are they friend or foe?

00:02:19.238 --> 00:02:20.840
It felt good.
I felt water on my face,

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.341
I said, where the hell
is that coming from from?

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:24.343
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.379
They may be doing that
on purpose.

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:28.748
Let's find out if they're
friend or foe.

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:31.918
And if they are foe, let's take
care of those son of a bitches.

00:02:31.918 --> 00:02:34.454
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:36.222
-Trump's like, "Friend or foe,
either way,

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.124
let's turn this into
a wet T-shirt contest.

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:40.827
Come on!
Those sons of bitches."

00:02:40.827 --> 00:02:43.296
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:46.031
Yeah, people were packed tightly
in unsanitary conditions

00:02:46.031 --> 00:02:47.867
and hosed down with water.

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.735
It's good to know his supporters
are being treated

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:51.270
like circus elephants.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.638
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.638 --> 00:02:54.707
And get this, with long waits
at the polls,

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.642
I heard you can hire
someone to stand in line

00:02:56.642 --> 00:02:58.678
and hold your place.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:03:00.446
And for an extra $50
on election night,

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:02.181
they'll scream into
a pillow for you.

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:05.351
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:07.119
You do that for voters,
you're patriotic.

00:03:07.119 --> 00:03:09.255
You do that at Disney, you're
dragged through Toontown

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:10.856
while they throw turkey legs
at you.

00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:12.725
"Shame! Shame!"

00:03:12.725 --> 00:03:14.727
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:17.129
You guys, Halloween is tomorrow
and everyone has plans,

00:03:17.129 --> 00:03:18.998
and some notable people
in Washington

00:03:18.998 --> 00:03:20.499
also have something going on.

00:03:20.499 --> 00:03:22.468
I'll show you what I mean.
For example,

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.636 line:0%
Mike Pence plans to
hand trick-or-treaters

00:03:24.636 --> 00:03:26.939 line:0%
his favorite hard candy,
ice cubes.

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:30.276 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.945 line:0%
Next up, Donald Trump, Jr.,
plans to inhale

00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:35.881 line:0%
a bunch of Pixy Stix
and go rant on Fox News.

00:03:35.881 --> 00:03:38.484 line:0%
-The media runs right away.
It's Russian disinformation.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:40.152 line:0%
There's literally zero evidence

00:03:40.152 --> 00:03:41.921 line:0%
that it's Russian
disinformation.

00:03:41.921 --> 00:03:44.189 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.189 --> 00:03:47.226 line:0%
-Steve Mnuchin plans to
tell kids for the last time,

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:49.062 line:0%
"I'm not dressed as McLovin."

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:52.431 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.431 --> 00:03:55.334 line:0%
Rudy Giuliani plans to
spend a quiet night at home

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:56.735 line:0%
tucking in his shirt.

00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:59.505 line:0%
That's...interesting.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:03.041 line:0%
Wilbur Ross plans to slowly
suck on a Werther's Original

00:04:03.041 --> 00:04:05.811 line:0%
until he nods off.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.811 --> 00:04:08.514 line:0%
That's kind of cute. Yeah.
I'm not sure about this --

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:10.650 line:0%
Joe Biden plans to bore
trick-or-treaters

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.185 line:0%
with long story about
how his friend Ron Caramel

00:04:13.185 --> 00:04:15.188 line:0%
invented the candy apple.

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:16.589 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:18.524 line:0%
And finally President Trump
plans to

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:21.026 line:0%
smile through a window
and be a human jack-o'-lantern.

00:04:21.026 --> 00:04:22.562 line:0%
Oh, well I hope
they all have fun.

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:24.463
[ Cheers and applause ]
I hope they have a good time,

00:04:24.463 --> 00:04:26.632
it's Halloween.

00:04:26.632 --> 00:04:29.201
Well, let's change gears,
I heard soon you'll be able

00:04:29.201 --> 00:04:32.371
to buy a brand new kind of milk.
Take a look.

00:04:32.371 --> 00:04:34.240 line:0%
-Nestle is coming out with

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:37.676 line:0%
Cinna-toast Crunch-flavored
milk, aka "Cinnamilk."

00:04:37.676 --> 00:04:40.446 line:0%
The new flavored milk tastes
like a epic combination

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.548 line:0%
of cinnamon and sugar
deliciousness,

00:04:42.548 --> 00:04:45.985 line:0%
with hints of toasted cereal
in every sip.

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:47.653
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:49.388
-Cows --
cows heard and were like,

00:04:49.388 --> 00:04:51.758
"I didn't realize what we did
wasn't enough for you."

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:54.159
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:55.695
And finally,
here's a weird story,

00:04:55.695 --> 00:04:57.863
a food writer in Georgia
just created a restaurant

00:04:57.863 --> 00:05:00.299
on her front porch
for chipmunks.

00:05:00.299 --> 00:05:01.534
Take a look.

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:09.708
-Yeah. Right now,
her kids are like,

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:12.211
"Okay, we need to talk
about Mom."

